<HelloFraandsPage title="Press" summary={`${BRAND.name} ki jaankari aur media sampark yahan milega.`}>
<h2>About {BRAND.name}</h2><p>{BRAND.name} is a place for adults in India to talk to real people by the minute. It brings together people looking for conversation and hosts who choose their own moods, languages and available hours. Calls use a private connection so neither person sees the other's personal phone number. The service is not dating, counselling or professional advice.</p>
<h2>Press details</h2><p>Company: {'{{COMPANY_NAME}}'}. Founder name: to be added.</p><p>Media enquiries: {'{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}'}.</p>
